\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Far off we need not rove
\par To find the God of love;
\par In His providential care,
\par Ever intimately near,
\par All His various works declare,
\par God, the bounteous God is here.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We live, and move, and are,
\par Through His preserving care;
\par He doth still in life maintain
\par Every soul that moves and lives;
\par Gives us back our breath again,
\par Being every moment gives.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Who live O God in Thee,
\par Entirely Thine should be:
\par Thine we are, a heaven-born race,
\par Only to Thy glory move,
\par Thee with all our powers we praise,
\par Thee with all our being love.
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

